{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_st03",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_st03",
  "title": "彻风雨",
  "storyCode": "HS-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dfe3874f1cc6a58010032f03df588ad8f1f49ace4f0973213cb3831196f72265",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......咳......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痨病的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就非要约我来爬这天岳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痨病的老人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个阳处的位置我先占了，你坐那边去。我身子没你好，你别跟我抢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出来散散步，晒晒太阳，尝尝这天岳的泉水，对你的身体有好处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真好笑，我们几十年没在那堵宫墙外打过照面，这次是你主动约的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......到底还是你先坐不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很难坐得住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玉门，大荒城。这一连串的事，总要一个说法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对，都是我干的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玉门山海众是我教唆的，睚也是我引入关的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些够把我拉下台吗？要是嫌不够，望是我放出京城的，那个孩子是我送去维多利亚的，邪魔的口子也是我撕开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要有需要，让三公的位置再空一个出来，这些事都可以是我干的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "山海众，乌合之众，能成什么气候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "睚，不过是条痨病兽，派上几十上百个天师，总能打发了，不过用来当作唤醒岁的口粮倒是正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老魔小丑，不足挂齿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳......咳......呼......说到底，我也不过是个老痨病鬼，我这条命，也就只剩这点用得到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不怕事情超出掌控，你从来不会怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我怕的东西可太多了......我怕“人心叵测”，我怕“大势所趋”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "见风使舵，一人拉一边，是求个平衡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可事到如今，那个罪人已经掀了棋盘，我们还有半分求和的可能吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玉门城已经修复完毕，在赶来京城的路上了。太傅大人，早做打算吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "复职信......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这封信原本不该由我来送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城的事件，那两个罪人的所作所为，朝廷已经得知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在司岁台、天师府、六部......朝野上下，全都忙成一团。我出公事路过大荒城，就代劳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是母亲她，拜托你来的吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......多谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这次代理人引发的动乱，朝中已经有结论了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玉门城已修复完毕，已重新启动驶向京城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是到了这一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你倒是镇定，我还以为你会立刻嚷嚷着要回到前线呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这段时间，我想明白一个道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恐惧才会急躁......越是不敢面对未知的敌人，就越想埋头冲过去，不管结果如何，只当给自己一个交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......可我现在不会害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些代理人，纵使有改天换地的能力，可说到底，他们也有人情人性，在这方面，祂们与我们并无不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“对手”并非不可捉摸，那就没什么好怕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "左公子，在下的确无意与你为敌。刚才说过的话，只希望左公子记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来日方长，我们还会有再见面的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还不错，左将军让你来这里修心，也不算白来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经准备妥当，随时可以动身。现在该去哪？玉门，还是百灶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不急，先回归一下你的本职工作吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有一个地方，与代理人接触颇多。虽说朝廷对那里并非一无所知，依照惯例，还是由司岁台去调查一下为好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......罗德岛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一批种子，有些种了出来，源石耐受性的表现比预想的要好，是时候带去外面的田地里做下一步培育了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是不是很辛苦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和在大荒城做的事一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......那你什么时候回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先是把种子送去全国各个粮食种植基地，培育第一批试种植株，再根据庄稼对不同土地的适应状况，找合适的培育方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要得出确切的结果，可能要十代以上的培育。应该是，很长一段时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......一代庄稼就是一年，十年......那是多长一段时间呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "够绵绵长得和他的爸爸妈妈一样大......好像也不是很长嘛，换了新饲料后，牧兽都长得飞快，每天都会变大一圈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是十年，也是要等忘花果树结十回酸果子......这么一想，又好像永远都等不到似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小满",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我再送送你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "笛声缠绵着，伴着夕阳跟在二人身后。泥土路上，两排脚印踏出去很远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "江南。\n大哥曾经说过，卸任之后，想去江南看看。\n几百年没有尝过江南夏天的菱角，见惯了黄沙戈壁，就在小桥流水的小镇里歇歇吧。只是要小心点，别再把这幅画打破了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "令始终忘不了那片大漠。\n她不是喜欢战争，只是喜欢沙场上人们的豪情万丈罢了......谁会不喜欢？\n画里没有吹角连营的战火，只有大漠孤烟，长河落日。你就安心在这里喝你的酒，当你的诗人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年会喜欢热闹的地方，但比起龙门，还是尚蜀的口味更适合她。\n你就老老实实在这里待着，别来烦我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二哥......应该只给他画一副棋盘的。\n心思都在算计上，审美也太差了点......这个园子送你，我也不想再见你了。\n算到最后，竟也没有给自己留半分退路，你到底......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "颉......\n要不是你太爱唠叨，又总摆一副姐姐的架子，我真的想过要找你学书法的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......行了，就这样吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "费了这些心思，谁知道大梦醒时，这些画还能不能留住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "留得下如何，留不下又如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来过了，见过了，千载春秋黄粱一梦，早就尽兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有你们在，我也不算孤单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "画家抛下笔，身形遁去。\n长空澄澈如白卷，有一行羽兽掠过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "长短还合身吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布料只有这一匹，要是不小心裁坏了，我可没地再找新的去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再合适不过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事到如今，再问这句话或许迟了一点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......胜算有几成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "半目胜负，生死之间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听起来，很容易亏得血本无归啊......也没有退路就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何时动手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "万事俱备，只欠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "农人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黍姑娘，我们这里的田都已经荒了几年了，真的还能种庄稼？方法使对了，就能种出粮食？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每片土地适合的作物不一样，改良土壤，还要用合适的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这拨种子已经种下去了，等秋天的时候，你们就能看到结果了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "农人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黍姑娘，您从哪来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "农人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您看起来这么年轻，对这田里的事懂得还真多......您说您是天师府的天师？天师是啥子玩意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是专门研究知识，再教给更多人的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "农人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真了不起啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "农人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黍姑娘，您先忙着，我去给您倒杯水去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "七月亨葵，九月授衣。春日载阳，有鸣仓庚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "九月筑场圃，十月纳禾稼，黍稷重穋，禾麻菽麦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“七月亨葵，九月授衣。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城冬天来得早，今年也得早些准备冬衣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐，用不用给你做一套新衣裳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我哪里用得上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我新琢磨了一种纺织办法，织出来的缎子又轻又耐用，颜色也好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我都想好了新衣裳的样子，你穿上肯定好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，随你吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样算是“人”的生活吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像......也算快乐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你已经真实地活过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，您教我那些行商的道理，我都已经了然于心。只是最后，我还是有一件事不解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "世间万物，飘渺如幻，我到底该如何估价？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看，我身上这个玉坠值几文钱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道这枚玉坠，不过是个寻常物件，在地摊上，最多卖二两银子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是这玉坠是我娘留给我的遗物，我从记事起就一直带着。对我来说，它价值无量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "估价，到头来，估的还是人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我记着了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快入夏了......江南荔枝正是好时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "北方天干，种出的荔枝就是不甜，比不上故乡的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本想这次回到老家，能再开一条商路，把南方的荔枝卖到北方去，结果隔着一道江，再也回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可恨这一场雨，实在不是时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等过两天入夏了，也等您身子暖起来，我们就雇条船过江。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了......我心里清楚，我的路，就到这了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人呐，为什么总是要逆天而行呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你今年，多大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们这种人的年龄，不太好算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一定要算的话，过了小暑，正好五十。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看得出来，你和常人不太一样......羡慕你有这么长的寿命，但是转念一想，这么长的一生啊，得多辛苦啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管你是什么样，我今年八十三了，你跟着我这么久，认你当养子，你也不算吃亏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "与您相逢一场，见过这片大地上无限风光，实属幸事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相逢有缘，我也没什么好赠与你的。除了那点不值钱的家业，就剩这句话了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天下熙熙，皆为利来；天下攘攘，皆为利往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这句话，我从学做生意的第一天起，就念叨到了现在。我也靠着这句话，赢了不少敌人对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可这天下，若是一个“利”字就说尽了，那未免也太无聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的时间不多了，走不了多少路。若你真的有那么漫长的寿命，那就替我去看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走遍这片大地，去看看这世上是否有一个能让普天下人共赢的“大利”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是真的能找到的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会记得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会去看看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
